| n=3 | idx 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| region | even | even | even | odd | odd | odd |
| example | 8 | 42 | 0 | 17 | 5 | 99 |

