| quota check | needed | budget |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 5 values x 41 | 205 | 300 elements, so feasible |
| adjacency | nonzero `a[i] != a[i-1]` | zeros may form runs |

Example prefix: `0 0 3 1 0 2 4 2 0 0 0 1 3 ...`

