**Key idea:** "Every 4 consecutive values are distinct" is the same as "each new value differs from the previous 3." Keep a 3-entry history queue, exclude it in the constraint, and update it in `post_randomize`.

| draw | history (last 3) | new value | window of 4 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | {} | 8 | 8 |
| 2 | {8} | 3 | 8 3 |
| 3 | {8,3} | 5 | 8 3 5 |
| 4 | {8,3,5} | 1 | 8 3 5 1 |
| 5 | {3,5,1} | 8 (allowed) | 3 5 1 8 |

