- Window W needs `W-1` history entries.
- The domain needs at least W values, or generation stalls.
- Pure constraint alternative for a fixed-length stream: `rand int v[100]; foreach (v[i]) foreach (v[j]) if (i < j && j - i < 4) v[i] != v[j];`.

